.TH FDATASYNC 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
fdatasync \- synchronize file data
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int fdatasync(int descriptor);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Flushes modified file data and metadata needed to retrieve it.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns zero, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fsync (3crunch),
.BR fdatasync (2)
